# oracle: pair_style comb3 polar_off on a 3x3x3-cell block (162 atoms, Cu/O, 12.81 A periodic box) of the examples/comb Cu2O crystal with its fixed charges (Cu +0.7, O -1.4, neutral), 0.05 A random displacement: run 0, then 20 NVE steps; per-atom forces and charges of the final state, thermo rows
# native: installed lmp (b332f28 build, which includes COMB3); the charges are the example's, fixed (no fix qeq/comb here).
# Measured error (engine vs native): worst per-atom force relative error 2.1e-12 (atom 101 vz, final state); charges agree within the 1e-12 absolute floor of the file check (filerel 1e-15 passes). Coulomb, charge forces included.
# oracle-inputs: w158cb_cuo.data
# oracle-potentials: ffield.comb3
# oracle-files: w158cb_static.q
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10 atomrel=1e-8 filerel=1e-8
units		metal
atom_style	charge
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
read_data	w158cb_cuo.data
displace_atoms  all random 0.05 0.05 0.05 4417 units box
pair_style	comb3 polar_off
pair_coeff	* * ffield.comb3 Cu O
neighbor	2.0 bin
neigh_modify	every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix		1 all nve
timestep        0.00020
thermo_style	custom step temp etotal pe evdwl ecoul press vol lx ly lz
thermo_modify	norm yes format float %.15g
thermo		10
run		0
run		20
write_dump all custom w158cb_static.q id q modify format float %.17g sort id
